@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+## Context
+
+`Coupons` tracks single-use coupons in `#usedBy` (coupon code to order id). `giveBack(code, order)` only deletes the entry when the stored order id equals `order`. `Orders.cancel` calls it with `order.customer`, so the ids never match.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Fix the caller: pass `id` (the order id) in `Orders.cancel`. `Coupons.giveBack` keeps its contract.
+- No money is involved, so `src/money.ts` is not touched.
+
+## Risks
+
+None known. Only single-use coupons are tracked, so other coupons are unaffected.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-coupon-giveback-on-cancel/proposal.md b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-20-fix-coupon-giveback-on-cancel/proposal.md
