@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Cancelling an order gives back its single-use coupon
+A single-use coupon SHALL be usable again once the order that used it is cancelled. A coupon that is not single-use is unaffected.
+
+#### Scenario: Re-use after cancellation
+- **WHEN** single-use coupon WELCOME is used by order ORD-0001 placed on 2026-03-02, ORD-0001 is cancelled on 2026-03-02, and a new order is placed on 2026-03-02 with WELCOME
+- **THEN** the new order is accepted and uses the coupon
+
+#### Scenario: Coupon stays used while the order stands
+- **WHEN** ORD-0001 used WELCOME and is not cancelled, and another order is placed with WELCOME
+- **THEN** the coupon is refused as already used
+
+#### Scenario: Cancellation on day 14
+- **WHEN** ORD-0001 placed on 2026-03-02 with WELCOME is cancelled on 2026-03-16
+- **THEN** the coupon can be used again
